<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin-dashboard.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin-users.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="admin-dashboard users-page">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>

    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="page-width header-content">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Mobility EHR home">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">M</span>
          <span>Mobility <span class="brand-label">EHR</span></span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/admin">Dashboard</a>
          <a href="/admin/intake">New intake</a>
          <a href="/admin/users" aria-current="page">User accounts</a>
          <a href="/admin/resources">Resources</a>
          <a href="/admin#clinic-management">Clinic management</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content" class="page-width">
      <div class="page-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Clinic administration</p>
          <h1>User Accounts and Roles</h1>
          <p class="intro">
            Review the account directory layout and the responsibilities planned
            for each role.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a class="secondary-link" href="/admin">Back to dashboard</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="preview-notice" aria-label="Prototype notice">
        <strong>Layout preview</strong>
        <span
          >Review the layout and fields. Records and actions will be added
          later.</span
        >
      </aside>

      <section
        id="role-guide"
        class="dashboard-section"
        aria-labelledby="roles-heading"
      >
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2 id="roles-heading">Roles at a glance</h2>
          <p>The responsibilities below describe the planned permissions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-grid">
          <article class="summary-card role-admin">
            <h3>Clinic Admin</h3>
            <p class="role-description">
              Manage accounts, roles, intake requests, therapist assignments,
              education resources, and flagged submissions.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="summary-card role-therapist">
            <h3>Physical Therapist</h3>
            <p class="role-description">
              View clinic intake information, evaluations, and home programs
              across patients. Document care and propose updates for any
              patient.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="summary-card role-patient">
            <h3>Patient</h3>
            <p class="role-description">
              View their own home programs and approved care updates. Manage
              their own home-program logs and symptom journals.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="role-note">
          Clinic staff will share viewing access to intake information,
          evaluations, and home programs. Therapists will not change account
          roles, and patients will access only their own information.
          Care-update approval responsibilities are still being defined.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section
        class="dashboard-section panel"
        aria-labelledby="accounts-heading"
      >
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <h2 id="accounts-heading">Account directory</h2>
          <p>
            Search and filter controls are shown for layout review. Account
            status is separate from care-episode status.
          </p>
        </div>

        <%# Filtering remains disabled until account records are connected. %>
        <div
          class="account-filters"
          role="group"
          aria-label="Planned account filters"
        >
          <div class="filter-search">
            <label for="account-search">Search accounts</label>
            <input
              id="account-search"
              name="q"
              type="search"
              maxlength="100"
              placeholder="Name, email, or account ID"
              disabled
            />
          </div>
          <div class="filter-field">
            <label for="account-role">Role</label>
            <select id="account-role" name="role" disabled>
              <option value="">All roles</option>
              <option value="admin">Clinic Admin</option>
              <option value="therapist">Physical Therapist</option>
              <option value="patient">Patient</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="filter-field">
            <label for="account-status">Account status</label>
            <select id="account-status" name="status" disabled>
              <option value="">All statuses</option>
              <option value="active">Active</option>
              <option value="inactive">Inactive</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="filter-actions">
            <button class="primary-link" type="button" disabled>
              Apply filters
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="table-container"
          role="region"
          aria-label="Account directory table"
          tabindex="0"
        >
          <table>
            <caption class="visually-hidden">
              Planned account directory columns
            </caption>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">Account</th>
                <th scope="col">Email</th>
                <th scope="col">Role</th>
                <th scope="col">Account status</th>
                <th scope="col">Created</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td colspan="5" class="empty-state">
                  <h3>Account list layout</h3>
                  <p>
                    Account records will appear here after the backend is
                    connected.
                  </p>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p class="panel-note">
          Creating accounts, editing details, assigning roles, and changing
          account status are planned for the account form.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer page-width">
      <p>Mobility EHR</p>
      <p>Educational prototype &middot; Interface design</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
